# Not needed to build or run the deployment; keeps the uploaded source small.
# Patterns are anchored to the repo root on purpose: an unanchored *.md would also drop
# prompts/*.md, which the agent reads at runtime, and kb/*.md. Everything `npm run build`
# reads (src, api, server.ts, scripts, kb, prompts, tsconfig*.json, vite.config.mjs,
# index.html) is deliberately not listed.
/docs
/tests
/perf
/ops
/eval
/Support-Ops-Automation
/coverage
/playwright-report
/playwright-report-live
/test-results
/Dockerfile
/docker-compose*.yml
/.dockerignore
/*.md
**/__tests__
**/*.test.*
